{"final":{"answer":"The reserve for product warranties increased by $6 million from 2005 to 2006, rising from $4 million at Dec. 31, 2005 to $10 million at Dec. 31, 2006. The change is explained by 2006 pretax warranty charges of $4 million plus $7 million of warranty obligations assumed in 2006 acquisitions, less $5 million of cash outlays (4 + 7 - 5 = 6).","value":6,"unit":"USD_million","sources":["source:q11n0","source:q12n0","source:q13n0","source:q14n0"],"result_id":"tool:1"}}